Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Mr. Speaker, the thrust of the COMELEC, which is the lead agency in the conduct of elections,

1809
02:09:16,400 --> 02:09:18,960
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: is to go 100% online.

1810
02:09:18,960 --> 02:09:21,280
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Except for three countries.

1811
02:09:21,840 --> 02:09:28,700
