1812
02:09:28,780 --> 02:09:33,020
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: mga training and information campaigns and dissemination outreach,

1813
02:09:33,540 --> 02:09:41,120
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: personally communicating with our kababayan OFWs to inform them,

1814
02:09:41,240 --> 02:09:48,120
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: to explain to them of the process and the importance and the sanctity of their votes, Mr. Speaker.

1815
02:09:48,960 --> 02:09:56,480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, maaaring bang mag-host ng mga focus group discussions or consultation ang DFA tungkol dito?

1816
02:09:56,480 --> 02:10:03,740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi po, kung sa bahagi lang po namin at i-share po namin sa inyong office na marami po talagang nananawagan

1817
02:10:03,740 --> 02:10:13,680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na kung pwede maging available pa rin yung ibang forma ng mga pagboto para sa mga Filipinos living and working overseas.

1818
02:10:13,680 --> 02:10:17,520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang mahalaga po na marinig mismo yung kanilang mga pangangailangan.

1819
02:10:17,520 --> 02:10:18,880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tulad ng nasabi ng atin,

1820
02:10:18,880 --> 02:10:26,960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ating distinguished sponsor, maaaring varying degrees po yan ng necessity pagdating sa variety sa iba't ibang mga lugar.

1821
02:10:27,400 --> 02:10:35,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya, ang maganda lang, yung pinakaunang dapat natin makausap tungkol sa bagay na ito ay nakonsulta natin.

1822
02:10:36,680 --> 02:10:44,080
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Mr. Speaker, the Comelec discusses, consults with the DFA,

1823
