Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: is the Comelec.

1825
02:10:50,840 --> 02:11:04,260
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: So, the DFA, they just merely inform the OFWs or the registered voters on the process approved by the Comelec, Mr. Speaker.

1826
02:11:05,160 --> 02:11:09,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat. At ginaw, Speaker, ang ulat sa atin ng Comelec, ang laki din ng budget cut nila

1827
02:11:09,980 --> 02:11:16,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagdating sa public information, voters' education, lalong-lalo na sa online.

1828
02:11:16,180 --> 02:11:18,660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Wala po silang pondo para mag-conduct.

1829
02:11:18,880 --> 02:11:21,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang mga satellite registration sa ibang bansa.

