3017
03:02:25,780 --> 03:02:29,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ay kailangan masama under ng MTRCB?

3018
03:02:29,780 --> 03:02:31,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Yes, Mr. Chair.

3019
03:02:31,780 --> 03:02:33,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Tama po kayo.

3020
03:02:33,780 --> 03:02:40,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Gusto ko po doon sa sinasabi nyo na kailangan ng panibagong batas para dito.

3021
03:02:40,780 --> 03:02:50,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Para po tama kayo na itong ngipin na sinasabi nyo na parang dalawa lang yung nasasakupan.

3022
03:02:50,780 --> 03:02:53,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: So kung magkakaroon tayo ng bagong batas,

3023
03:02:53,780 --> 03:02:55,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: sa pamamigitan ng support natin dito,

3024
03:02:55,780 --> 03:02:57,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: sa House of Representatives,

3025
03:02:57,780 --> 03:03:02,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: ay mapapalawak po natin ang saklaw, ang sakop po ng ahensya.

3026
03:03:02,780 --> 03:03:08,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: At maging content regulatory board po ang tawag doon.

3027
03:03:08,780 --> 03:03:10,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So ito ho bang sample?

3028
03:03:10,780 --> 03:03:19,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Netflix, HBO, Disney, at yung paborito ni Kong Jet, yung Viva Max.

3029
03:03:19,780 --> 03:03:22,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Eh nakakuha ho ba kayo ng ano dito?

3030
03:03:22,780 --> 03:03:24,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kahit pa paano ng fees?

3031
03:03:24,780 --> 03:03:31,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Share po pag ito po ino-online o nag-streaming sa ating bansa?

3032
03:03:31,780 --> 03:03:33,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Wala po.

3033
03:03:33,780 --> 03:03:41,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Ang MTRCB po ay talagang tinitinglan lang nila yung video and classification.

3034
03:03:41,780 --> 03:03:50,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Kaya nga hinihikayat ko tayo dito na magtulungan para nga po magkaroon tayo ng panibagong batas.

3035
03:03:50,780 --> 03:03:52,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Para masakop nila, masaklaw nila.

3036
03:03:52,780 --> 03:03:56,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Yung lahat ng pinangalanan niyo kanina.

3037
03:03:56,780 --> 03:03:59,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So in short, Mrs. Speaker, no?

3038
03:03:59,780 --> 03:04:05,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ah, ang MTRCB wala talagang ipin pagdating sa mga streaming neto.

3039
03:04:05,780 --> 03:04:09,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi ngayon, no, halos wala na nagpupunta ng siniyan, no?

3040
03:04:09,780 --> 03:04:13,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Or bihira na manood ng TV, free TV.

3041
03:04:13,780 --> 03:04:18,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So ano ang gusto niyong gawin na batas para maisama to?

3042
03:04:18,780 --> 03:04:21,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi ang number one dito, importante rito, itong mga kabataan.

3043
03:04:21,780 --> 03:04:26,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Kasi dito, kung hindi niyo maka-classify, napakarami na ito.

3044
03:04:26,780 --> 03:04:29,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I think you need AI para ma-

3045
03:04:29,780 --> 03:04:35,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ilan ho ba ang nagka-classify sa MTRCB pagdating po dito sa mga streaming na ganito?

3046
03:04:35,780 --> 03:04:36,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Ilan ba tayo?

3047
03:04:39,780 --> 03:04:48,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Valley 31 po ang board members na tumitingin sa mga nag-review.

3048
03:04:48,780 --> 03:04:50,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Kaya nga po, Mr. Chair,

3049
03:04:51,780 --> 03:04:58,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: kailangan po natin masuportahan para mas madami pa silang empleyado.

3050
03:04:58,780 --> 03:05:06,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: At kung gagawa tayo ng panibagong batas, mas malaki ang saklaw na ma-review po nila.

3051
03:05:06,780 --> 03:05:11,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Hindi na lang yung television and movies.

3052
03:05:11,780 --> 03:05:20,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Pati na rin po yung Vivamox, yung Netflix, kung ano pa man yung mga other social media platforms, Mr. Chair.

3053
03:05:20,780 --> 03:05:27,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ano mo, Mr. Chair, Mr. Speaker, nakakalunos naman ang MTRCB.

3054
03:05:27,780 --> 03:05:40,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Napakarami ng mga streaming. Iba pa yung mga reels sa cellphone na lumalabas na kada pindot mo, nagbabayad sila.

3055
03:05:40,780 --> 03:05:45,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Wala rin mo ba yung share doon sa mga reels na yan sa cellphone?

3056
03:05:45,780 --> 03:05:49,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Sa mga movie platforms, walang share ang MTRCB.

3057
03:05:49,780 --> 03:05:56,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Pero bagkos dahil sa marami silang nire-review, sila po ay self-generating agency.

3058
03:05:56,780 --> 03:06:00,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Meron po silang 640 million na nasa treasury.

3059
03:06:00,780 --> 03:06:10,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Ang supporta lang po na hinihingi nila sa atin ay 49.987 million na para po sa personal services.

3060
03:06:10,780 --> 03:06:17,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: So ini-encourage po natin, ako nag-i-encourage sa mga, to our dear colleagues,

3061
03:06:17,780 --> 03:06:18,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: na suportahan natin sila.

3062
03:06:19,780 --> 03:06:26,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Kasi malaki ang naitutulong nila sa atin, sa ating bansa.

3063
03:06:26,780 --> 03:06:28,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Madam Sponsor.

3064
03:06:28,780 --> 03:06:36,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, where should the line be drawn between content properly regulated by the MTRCB

3065
03:06:36,780 --> 03:06:46,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and content that should remain under the jurisdiction of the Department of Information and Communication Technology or DICT

3066
03:06:46,780 --> 03:06:48,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and the National Telecommunications Commission?

3067
03:06:48,780 --> 03:06:53,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Law enforcement agency or the platforms themselves?

3068
03:06:53,780 --> 03:07:01,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Meron mo ba rin ba ang ibang agencies ng DICT, National Telecommunications Commission?

3069
03:07:01,780 --> 03:07:05,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Nagka-classified din mo ba sila pagdating sa mga content neto?

3070
03:07:05,780 --> 03:07:16,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Chair, magkaiba po yung functions ng agency na nabanggit ninyo kasi nga po, limited po yung function ng MTRCB.

3071
03:07:16,780 --> 03:07:22,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Sa movie and television classification lang po.

3072
03:07:22,780 --> 03:07:24,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Madam Sponsor.

3073
03:07:24,780 --> 03:07:36,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, if Congress places streaming platforms under MTRCB, what regulatory framework does the Board recommend

3074
03:07:36,780 --> 03:07:42,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: that will be effective without requiring prior government review of every title?

3075
03:07:45,780 --> 03:07:56,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Meron po silang administrative regulatory powers at may feedback din po, mechanism.

3076
03:07:56,780 --> 03:08:03,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: But under PD-1986, you only covered television and movies, right?

3077
03:08:03,780 --> 03:08:04,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Opo.

3078
03:08:04,780 --> 03:08:11,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Eto, streaming ng platforms. So ano sa tingin mo ang pwede niyo i-recommenda?

3079
03:08:11,780 --> 03:08:13,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So if we file a bill,

3080
03:08:13,780 --> 03:08:21,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: para pag naisama to, ano sa tingin mo ang magiging priority niyo o functions niyo dito?

3081
03:08:21,780 --> 03:08:35,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Dapat po maging held accountable yung mga platform or agencies para po kapag may concerns, may i-address po natin lahat yun.

3082
03:08:35,780 --> 03:08:42,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, right now, etong mga social media platforms o streaming neto,

3083
03:08:43,780 --> 03:08:47,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: may office na ba sila rito sa ating bansa?

3084
03:08:47,780 --> 03:08:51,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: I was sad to say wala po, Mr. Chair.

3085
03:08:51,780 --> 03:08:52,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So wala sila?

3086
03:08:52,780 --> 03:08:54,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Hindi po talaga sakop ng MTRCB yan.

3087
03:08:54,780 --> 03:09:00,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So even though pinalalabas natin dito sa ating bansa ang kanilang mga streaming, wala?

3088
03:09:00,780 --> 03:09:11,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Wala po. Kaya po, dapat ulitin ko, Mr. Chair, na supportahan natin sila sa panibagong batas para masakop po natin lahat ng constraints.

3089
03:09:11,780 --> 03:09:16,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, nasa nang kanilang opisina? Huwag niyo sabihin sa Singapore na naman.

3090
03:09:16,780 --> 03:09:18,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Meron din po doon.

3091
03:09:18,780 --> 03:09:19,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sa Singapore?

3092
03:09:19,780 --> 03:09:20,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Yung Meta po.

3093
03:09:20,780 --> 03:09:27,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Si Meta. That's why yesterday, Mr. Speaker, dinefer natin because ito na naman ang problema natin, ang Meta.

3094
03:09:27,780 --> 03:09:40,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Remember last night, I think someone from DICT sinabi nga na number five users tayo when it comes to Meta.

3095
03:09:40,780 --> 03:09:47,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: When it comes to Meta platforms. And yet, wala silang opisina rito sa atin.

3096
03:09:47,780 --> 03:09:48,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Opo.

3097
03:09:48,780 --> 03:10:00,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So ito na naman ang tanong ko, kagaya na itong mga Netflix, HBO, wala na naman silang opisina. So, kumbaga, ibang bansa kumikita pero sila pinagkakakitaan tayo rito sa ating bansa.

3098
03:10:00,780 --> 03:10:09,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I think it's high time, Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor, na dapat tayo magkaisa rito na palakasin natin ang MTRCB,

3099
03:10:10,780 --> 03:10:13,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ang ating DICT, para itong mga foreigner na kumikita sa atin ay managot sila.

3100
03:10:17,780 --> 03:10:21,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: or mag-employ man lang ng empleyado rito sa ating bansa. Ibang bansa pa

3101
03:10:21,780 --> 03:10:23,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: nakikinabang.

3102
03:10:23,780 --> 03:10:32,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So again, Mr. Speaker, kailangan nating magkaisa rito. And believe me, no less than Kong Santos of Las Piñas,

3103
03:10:32,780 --> 03:10:34,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: sigurado akong magfa-file ng bill.

3104
03:10:34,780 --> 03:10:36,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Together with Kong Gil Acosta.

3105
03:10:37,780 --> 03:10:39,780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Again, moving forward, Mr. Speaker.

3106
03:10:39,780 --> 03:10:45,480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Madam, Mr. Speaker, ito pong mga complaints natin.

3107
03:10:45,680 --> 03:10:52,320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What sanctions should apply for repeated misclassification or failure to act on complaints?

3108
03:11:00,880 --> 03:11:02,980
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Pwedeng pakiulit, Mr. Chair?

3109
03:11:02,980 --> 03:11:10,020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yung mga, anong sanctions na ibinibigay natin sa mga repeat offender, yung mga misclassification,

3110
03:11:11,080 --> 03:11:14,700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: meron mo bang dumarating sa inyo ng misclassification pag nagre-review kayo?

3111
03:11:15,520 --> 03:11:21,980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Na kunyari, sabi nila, itong peliko lang ito, rated PG, tapos pagdating may mga content pala

3112
03:11:22,660 --> 03:11:29,120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: na hindi nais-nais na mapanood ng mga, yung parental guidance na sinasabi natin.

3113
03:11:30,480 --> 03:11:32,940
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Bago po natin mailagay on air,

3114
03:11:32,980 --> 03:11:35,880
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: nire-review po yan ng MTRCB.

3115
03:11:36,720 --> 03:11:40,340
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: From the start, talagang nire-review nila yun.

3116
03:11:40,700 --> 03:11:48,440
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mula noong 2025, pinalakas po ng MTRCB ang responsabling panunood campaign

3117
03:11:48,440 --> 03:11:50,980
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: sa pamamagitan ng PROTECT framework.

3118
03:11:52,060 --> 03:11:54,360
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Ang PROTECT framework po ay

3119
03:11:54,360 --> 03:11:59,980
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: ang P, provide guidance on age-appropriate content.

3120
03:12:00,700 --> 03:12:02,740
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Yung R, regulate.

3121
03:12:02,980 --> 03:12:06,480
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: A, create screen time and set healthy limits.

3122
03:12:07,160 --> 03:12:11,320
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: O, observe co-viewing and family discussions.

3123
03:12:12,220 --> 03:12:14,900
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: T, teach medial literacy.

3124
03:12:15,720 --> 03:12:19,760
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: And E, educate children on the impact of media.

3125
03:12:20,140 --> 03:12:23,820
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: And C, create a family viewing plan.

3126
03:12:24,480 --> 03:12:30,480
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: T, take the lead by setting a good example in content consumption.

3127
03:12:30,480 --> 03:12:32,860
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: So, yung PROTECT,

3128
03:12:33,140 --> 03:12:34,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: framework po,

3129
03:12:34,920 --> 03:12:36,020
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Chair,

3130
03:12:36,680 --> 03:12:39,100
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: may baseline po sila dito.

3131
03:12:39,760 --> 03:12:41,160
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: May surveys,

3132
03:12:41,600 --> 03:12:43,580
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: bago yung programa.

3133
03:12:44,420 --> 03:12:47,480
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Tapos, meron din post-engagement surveys

3134
03:12:47,480 --> 03:12:49,740
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: pagkatapos ng programa.

3135
03:12:51,040 --> 03:12:54,260
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Yung impact assessments sa mga komunidad

3136
03:12:54,260 --> 03:12:56,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: na dating naabot ng programa.

3137
03:12:56,560 --> 03:12:59,000
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Yun po yung mga ginagawa ng MTRCB.

