Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: paano mapanatili ang serbisyo

3986
03:48:52,420 --> 03:48:53,760
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: at oportunidad

3987
03:48:53,760 --> 03:48:56,660
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: para sa filmmakers at film workers.

3988
03:48:57,820 --> 03:49:00,380
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: At sa proposed 2027 budget

3989
03:49:00,380 --> 03:49:04,160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: nila na umaabot po ng 300.7 million,

3990
03:49:04,880 --> 03:49:05,960
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: paano tinitiyak

3991
03:49:05,960 --> 03:49:08,000
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: ng Film Development Council

3992
03:49:08,000 --> 03:49:10,920
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: ang suporta nito sa Pilipino filmmakers,

3993
03:49:11,800 --> 03:49:12,440
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: film workers,

3994
03:49:12,840 --> 03:49:16,420
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: at sa development ng ating local film industry?

3995
03:49:17,000 --> 03:49:18,100
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Chair,

3996
03:49:20,200 --> 03:49:28,580
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: FDCP po ay malawak ang pangarap para po sa ating sining, sa ating bansa.

3997
03:49:29,520 --> 03:49:35,080
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Meron po tayong mga scholars na mga kabataan all over the Philippines,

3998
03:49:35,420 --> 03:49:37,180
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: filmmakers nationwide.

3999
03:49:37,920 --> 03:49:39,560
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mga scholars po sila.

4000
03:49:39,560 --> 03:49:47,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Minsan nakakaawa nga po kasi as of kwento ni Director Joy,

4001
03:49:47,400 --> 03:49:55,780
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: yung budget na binibigay lang minsan ay P50,000 para sa mga filmmakers natin.

4002
03:49:56,160 --> 03:50:02,520
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Kung hindi natin susuportahan, mawawalan po tayo ng mga bagong idea

4003
03:50:02,520 --> 03:50:07,500
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: kung paano po gumawa ng pindikalidad na movie sa ating bansa.

4004
03:50:07,500 --> 03:50:13,020
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: At hindi po natin, para sa ahensya na ito,

4005
03:50:13,180 --> 03:50:17,380
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: hindi po natin pwedeng hayaan na mawala yun sa ating,

4006
03:50:17,400 --> 03:50:22,600
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: dahil ang ibang bansa po ay niyayakap po nila talaga

4007
03:50:22,600 --> 03:50:27,240
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: ang mga talento ng kanilang mga artista.

4008
03:50:27,640 --> 03:50:34,360
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Dito po sa atin, meron tayong mga scholars nga po nationwide

4009
03:50:34,360 --> 03:50:36,420
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: na sinusuportahan po natin.

4010
03:50:36,800 --> 03:50:41,860
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Maliban pa po doon, ang prayer po talaga ng FDCP

4011
03:50:41,860 --> 03:50:46,260
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: ay magkaroon po tayo ng film archiving

4012
03:50:46,260 --> 03:50:47,380
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: na kung saan,

4013
03:50:47,400 --> 03:50:53,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: nawawala na po ang kasaysayan ng pelikulang Pilipino.

4014
03:50:53,400 --> 03:50:59,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Meron po tayong mga lumang movies na nakukuha pa po sa ibang bansa.

4015
03:50:59,400 --> 03:51:03,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Imaginin po natin, sarili nating mga pelikula nung mga 1930s,

4016
03:51:03,400 --> 03:51:08,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: mga early 1900s, na wala na po sa ating bansa.

4017
03:51:08,400 --> 03:51:10,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Nasa ibang bansa pa po natin nakukuha.

4018
03:51:10,400 --> 03:51:16,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: At hindi po ganun kamura para po i-restore natin yung mga old movies.

4019
03:51:16,400 --> 03:51:17,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: At hindi po ganun kamura para po i-restore natin yung mga old movies.

4020
03:51:17,400 --> 03:51:26,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Ang isang pelikula po na luma ay, it depends po kung gaano kalawak yung sira.

4021
03:51:26,400 --> 03:51:33,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Minsan po, ang isang movie ay nagkakahalaga ng 2 million para ma-restore po ito.

4022
03:51:33,400 --> 03:51:40,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Kung hindi naman ganun kalaki ang damage, umaabot pa rin po ng isang million.

4023
03:51:40,400 --> 03:51:45,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: So million po talaga ang halaga ng bawat isang pelikula

4024
03:51:45,400 --> 03:51:55,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: para maitago natin, mailagay natin sa archive yung kasaysayan ng pelikulang Pilipino, Mr. Chair.

4025
03:51:55,400 --> 03:51:58,400
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Maraming salamat, Madam Sponsor.

4026
03:51:58,400 --> 03:52:03,400
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang susunod ko pong katanungan ay may kinalaman sa Film Development Council Grants.

4027
03:52:03,400 --> 03:52:13,400
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor, sa 2027, target ng Film Development Council na 30% ng films na bibigyan ng incentives o grants

4028
03:52:13,400 --> 03:52:14,400
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: ay maibigay based on merit.

4029
03:52:14,400 --> 03:52:24,400
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Habang 50% naman ng award-winning producers, directors, at actors ay bibigyan ng priority sa pag-avail ng incentives o grants.

4030
03:52:24,400 --> 03:52:31,400
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Paano po tinitiyak ng Film Development Council na ang grant system ay parehong merit-based at accessible,

4031
03:52:31,400 --> 03:52:37,400
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: lalo na para sa mga emerging filmmakers na wala pang awards o established industry connections?

4032
03:52:37,400 --> 03:52:43,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Chair, ito po ay pinag-aaralan at pinagpapasyahan.

4033
03:52:44,400 --> 03:52:49,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Ito po ay pinag-aaralan at pinagpapasyahan ng independent committee or selection.

4034
03:52:49,400 --> 03:53:04,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Sinusunod ng committee ang mga itinakdang pamantayan tulad ng creative merit, global appeal, at yung epekto po sa ating ekonomiya, Mr. Chair.

4035
03:53:04,400 --> 03:53:13,400
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Madam Sponsor, mahalaga po ito dahil may mga filmmaker na mataas ang potensyal pero wala pang established track record.

4036
03:53:13,400 --> 03:53:22,400
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Dapat malinaw kung paano po binabalanse ang quality, merit, experience, at pagkakataong makapasok ang bagong talento sa industriya.

4037
03:53:22,400 --> 03:53:30,400
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang pangatlong katanungan ko naman po ay may kinalaman sa Create PH Films at pagpapalaki ng support sa filmmakers.

4038
03:53:30,400 --> 03:53:42,400
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor, ngayong 2026 ay pinalawak ng Film Development Council ang Create PH Films, kabilang ang pagsama ng animation at documentary projects.

4039
03:53:43,400 --> 03:53:51,400
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Pagtaas ng maximum project development grant mula sa 300,000 pesos na naging 500,000 pesos.

4040
03:53:51,400 --> 03:54:11,400
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang pagpapalawak ng production, funding, hanggang post-production sa 2027, paano po titiyakin ng Film Development Council na ang expanded assistance na ito ay tunay na nakakatulong sa filmmakers na makumpleto ang kanilang projects at hindi lamang nakatutok sa initial development.

4041
03:54:13,400 --> 03:54:41,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Chair, through the Create PH Films funding program and in line with its mandate under Republic Act 9167, FTCP provides financial and logistical support across all stages of filmmaking development, production, post-production, marketing, distribution, exhibition, and production.

4042
03:54:43,400 --> 03:54:57,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: and archiving. Through this program, the government reinforces its commitment to nurturing quality Filipino films and promoting the growth of Philippine cinema. Mr. Chair.

4043
03:54:57,400 --> 03:55:12,400
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Madam Sponsor, follow-up questions lamang po. Ilang projects po ang target na masuportahan ng Create PH Films sa 2027 at ilan dito ang inaasahang matatapos at marirelease sa publiko?

4044
03:55:13,400 --> 03:55:34,340
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Chair, it depends po sa quality, sa kalidad ng mga pelikula na naisasubmit po sa FTCP. Ang allocation po ng budget para sa mga programing ito ay 51 million, Mr. Chair.

4045
03:55:36,080 --> 03:55:42,780
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor, pagdating po sa trabaho at kabuhayan sa film industry.

4046
03:55:43,400 --> 03:55:58,360
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Ang film industry ay hindi lamang tungkol sa actors at directors. Kasama rito ang camera crew, editors, production staff, designers, technicians, writers, at iba pang workers na umasa sa regular na projects para sa kanilang kabuhayan.

4047
03:55:58,520 --> 03:56:13,320
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Sa budget documents po, isa sa outcome indicators ng Film Development Council ay ang percentage increase sa film workers na nabigyan ng employment. Ano po ang kanilang methodology sa pagbilang ng film workers?

4048
03:56:13,400 --> 03:56:22,160
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Na nabigyan ng employment? At ano po ang konkreto nitong programa upang magkaroon ng mas sustainable na trabaho at livelihood opportunities sa industriya?

4049
03:56:22,180 --> 03:56:31,620
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Chair, hindi po sa cloud ng FTCP yung usapin na yan. Nasasakupan po yan ng Film Academy of the Philippines. Mr. Chair.

4050
03:56:32,840 --> 03:56:39,720
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Maraming salamat, Madam Sponsor. Pagdating naman po sa Film Heritage Preservation, kanina po nabanggit po ninyo.

4051
03:56:39,720 --> 03:56:40,320
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Opo.

4052
03:56:43,400 --> 03:56:59,280
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Nung 2027, target ay 1,320 films na evaluated at considered for restoration. 1,701 audiovisual elements to be managed and preserved. Ngunit isang film lamang ang target na ma-restore.

4053
03:56:59,540 --> 03:57:08,380
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Nung 2025, isang film din ang aktual na na-restore. Ano po ang pangunahing constraint kung bakit isa lamang ang annual restoration target?

4054
03:57:10,840 --> 03:57:13,380
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Chair, matatandahan hindi.

4055
03:57:13,400 --> 03:57:28,520
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mayroon po natin na sa nakaraang taon, wala pong budget na naibigay ang Kongreso sa Film Development Council of the Philippines sa restoration and archiving.

4056
03:57:28,520 --> 03:57:39,960
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Kaya nga po sa panahon ito, sana po ay suportahan natin sila para naman po ay mapanood pa po ng ating mga future generation yung mga old movies natin.

4057
03:57:40,440 --> 03:57:43,380
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Yung mga ating mga anak ay makita pa rin.

4058
03:57:43,400 --> 03:57:53,320
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: At yung mga anak ay makita pa rin nila na maganda at kung gaano kadikalidad yung mga movies natin nung mga nakaraang panahon.

4059
03:57:53,800 --> 03:58:11,180
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Kaya yun po yung number one actually na priority ng FDCP na magkaroon tayo ng mga suporta sa mga filmmakers at sa film archiving po. Thank you.

4060
03:58:11,560 --> 03:58:12,700
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Maraming salamat.

4061
03:58:13,400 --> 03:58:26,620
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Pagdating naman po sa students and young filmmakers, kabilang sa mga programa ng FDCP, ang Student Film Assistance Program at mga youth-oriented initiatives tulad ng Sine Kabataan,

4062
03:58:27,300 --> 03:58:37,560
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: sa 2026, ang Student Film Assistance Program ay nagbibigay ng 30,000 pesos hanggang 50,000 pesos na grants para sa student filmmakers.

4063
03:58:37,560 --> 03:58:43,360
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Paano po tinitiyak ng FDCP na ang ganitong early assistance ay nagiging pathway para sa kabataan?

4064
03:58:43,400 --> 03:58:47,320
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Na makapasok at magpatuloy sa professional film industry?

4065
03:58:48,000 --> 03:58:54,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Chair, napakalaking tulong po sa ating mga young filmmakers yung amount na yan.

4066
03:58:55,000 --> 03:59:05,480
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: At para sa akin or para sa passion po kasi ni Direk Joey talaga, yung magturo.

4067
03:59:05,480 --> 03:59:13,340
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: He is an educator. Nagtuturo po talaga siya kahit sa lasal or pumupunta po siya sa iba-ibang...

4068
03:59:13,400 --> 03:59:20,400
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: region sa ating bansa para i-encourage niya yung kabataan.

4069
03:59:20,400 --> 03:59:32,000
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Kaya kung sana po yung amount na 50,000 ay madagdagan pa natin kasi parang hindi nga po sapat pero dahil po yun ang pangarap ng mga kabataan natin,

4070
03:59:32,000 --> 03:59:37,000
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: yun yung passion nila, pinagkakasya po nila yung amount na yun.

4071
03:59:37,000 --> 03:59:42,960
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Kaya sana po hinihiling natin na supportahan natin ang ating mga young,

4072
03:59:42,960 --> 03:59:49,960
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: young filmmakers at ang mithiin ng ating FDCP, Mr. Chair.

4073
03:59:50,960 --> 03:59:59,960
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor, nais ko pong ipahayag ang aking suporta sa Film Development Council of the Philippines at sa mga programa nito upang patuloy na mapaunlad.

4074
04:00:00,000 --> 04:00:04,200
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: ang ating local film industry at mapangalagaan ng ating film heritage.

4075
04:00:04,860 --> 04:00:08,000
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mahalaga po ang investment ng pamahalaan sa ating mga filmmaker,

4076
04:00:08,320 --> 04:00:12,220
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: film workers at mga kabataan dahil ang pelikula ay bahagi

4077
04:00:12,220 --> 04:00:15,700
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: hindi lamang ng ating kultura kundi ng creative economy

4078
04:00:15,700 --> 04:00:19,720
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: at ang pagkukwento ng bawat pahina ng buhay ng Pilipino.

4079
04:00:20,200 --> 04:00:23,820
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Nawa ay mas mapalawak pa at mas maraming Pilipino talents

4080
04:00:23,820 --> 04:00:27,560
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: ang mabigyan ng oportunidad at mas marami pa rin tayong pelikulang

4081
04:00:27,560 --> 04:00:31,460
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: mapanood at mapakinabangan ng publiko habang patuloy nating

4082
04:00:31,460 --> 04:00:34,460
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: pinoprotektahan ang ating cinematic heritage.

4083
04:00:36,280 --> 04:00:42,520
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, in behalf of the minority, I move to terminate.

4084
04:00:42,520 --> 04:00:45,480
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: ...

4085
04:00:45,480 --> 04:00:46,060
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: May question pa?

4086
04:00:47,900 --> 04:00:48,520
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Okay, okay.

4087
04:00:50,980 --> 04:00:55,240
Rep. Jernie Jett V. Nisay: Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor, thank you, thank you very much.

4088
04:00:56,220 --> 04:00:57,100
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: You are the leader.

4089
04:00:57,560 --> 04:01:04,140
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Mr. Speaker, next to interpelate the sponsor, I move to recognize

4090
04:01:04,140 --> 04:01:07,940
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Representative Rene Luisco of Partylist Kabataan.

4091
04:01:08,340 --> 04:01:11,180
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: René Luisco is recognized.

4092
04:01:12,780 --> 04:01:17,500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, and good afternoon to our distinguished sponsor

4093
04:01:17,500 --> 04:01:23,620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and to FDCP. Actually, our colleague earlier already touched on

4094
04:01:23,620 --> 04:01:27,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: some of the questions we'd like to ask, lalo na po tungkol sa sinikabataan.

4095
04:01:27,560 --> 04:01:34,340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But maybe just like a few more details tungkol po sa paano po nasusuportaan

4096
04:01:34,340 --> 04:01:42,600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng Create PH Films ang mga up and young, up and coming young filmmakers.

4097
04:01:43,460 --> 04:01:48,960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, of course, while we commend the FDCP for increasing the Create PH Films

4098
04:01:48,960 --> 04:01:54,260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: project development grant from 300,000 to 500,000, we must look at the

4099
04:01:54,260 --> 04:01:56,400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: operational reality on the ground.

4100
04:01:56,400 --> 04:02:57,560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Under current auditing guidelines, grant distributions are heavily reliant on tranche liquidations and post-expense reimbursements. Madali lang po 'yun for established production houses. Kaya po nilang i-outlay 'yung 500,000 to 1 million upfront while waiting for government tranche releases. 'Yun nga lang po, for young emerging independent storytellers without large capital reserves, this upfront expense requirement is a massive barrier to entry. Paano po ba, ano pong ginagawa ng FDCP upang ma-address itong cash flow bottleneck para ma-ensure na 'yung mga maaawardan ng grants hindi po maihinto sa early production dahil wala pong immediate operational capital? Ito po kasi 'yung kinonsulta natin sa ating mga young filmmakers na issue kung bakit hindi po sila makapagsimula in the first place.

4101
04:02:57,560 --> 04:03:07,480
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Mr. Chair, meron po tayong training karampatan sa mga young filmmakers

4102
04:03:07,480 --> 04:03:13,820
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: na sinisigurado po natin yung funds na talagang nabubuhos po sa kanila.

4103
04:03:13,820 --> 04:03:22,820
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Dahil sinabi ko nga kanina na si Direct Joey ay passion niya po talaga ang filmmaking.

4104
04:03:22,820 --> 04:03:35,820
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Kailangan magkaroon po tayo ng mga young minds para masuportahan ang scening ng movies ng ating bansa.

4105
04:03:37,820 --> 04:03:42,820
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Sa nakaraang taon, hindi nga po sila nabigyan ng budget.

4106
04:03:42,820 --> 04:03:50,820
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Kaya dito po sa panahon na ito, nakikiusap po ang FTCP na sana po ay bigyang tugon

4107
04:03:50,820 --> 04:03:52,820
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: yung kanilang budget.

4108
04:03:52,820 --> 04:03:58,820
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: Kailangan natin sila panawagan, yung wish nila na mabigyan natin sila ng importansya

4109
04:03:58,820 --> 04:04:08,820
Rep. Lolita T. Javier: para sa ating kabataan masuportahan po natin yung ating mga filmmakers, Mr. Chair.

4110
04:04:08,820 --> 04:04:12,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Chair, good sponsor.

4111
04:04:12,820 --> 04:04:21,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sinusuportahan natin yung pagdagdag ng budget for the Create PH Films Project Development Grant.

4112
04:04:21,820 --> 04:04:24,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At lalo na po para sa sinekabataan.

4113
04:04:24,820 --> 04:04:32,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung concern lang natin ay kung ang iskema, kung paano mabibigyan ng pera,

4114
04:04:32,820 --> 04:04:39,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang maaari pong maka-avail nito ay reimbursement mechanism.

4115
04:04:39,820 --> 04:04:44,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Lalo na po sa mga magsisimula pa lang ng career.

4116
04:04:44,820 --> 04:04:50,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Baka hindi po in the first place magkaroon ng oportunidad na masimulan.

4117
04:04:50,820 --> 04:04:57,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang pinikula dahil sa hirap na makuha yung ganitong klaseng pondo.

4118
04:04:57,820 --> 04:05:02,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So siyempre sana at maganda na marireimburse.

4119
04:05:02,820 --> 04:05:11,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero kung ang kailangan ay upfront capital, ano po bang guarantee na matutuloy-tuloy po ito ng isang kabataan?

4120
04:05:11,820 --> 04:05:19,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Siguro ang tanong na lang po, Madam Speaker, may intensyon, may plano po bang FTCP to streamline internal finance?

4121
04:05:19,820 --> 04:05:21,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Internal finance mechanisms?

4122
04:05:21,820 --> 04:05:27,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pwede po ba siyang mag-partner sa state financing institutions to provide immediate capital?

4123
04:05:27,820 --> 04:05:34,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: O kaya naman po, low interest advances bago po ay upon contract signing?

4124
04:05:34,820 --> 04:05:39,820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Para po hindi mabigat sa bulsa ng kabataan yung pagsisimula ng pelikula.

4125
04:05:39,820 --> 04:05:45,820
