04:22:21,080 --> 04:22:25,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 838,656,000.

4312
04:22:25,260 --> 04:22:25,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

4313
04:22:26,380 --> 04:22:27,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you for that clarification.

4314
04:22:27,860 --> 04:22:29,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Malinaw na error po.

4315
04:22:29,840 --> 04:22:30,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nakita natin

4316
04:22:30,720 --> 04:22:33,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na may mali sa GAA.

4317
04:22:33,800 --> 04:22:34,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

4318
04:22:34,420 --> 04:22:34,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Now,

4319
04:22:35,680 --> 04:22:35,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: well,

4320
