Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Ang pinag-protectan po ay 10 wika.

5304
05:51:20,600 --> 05:51:23,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 10 wika? Ano-ano po yun?

5305
05:51:23,200 --> 05:51:24,620
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Ang pinakamalubhang nanganganib.

5306
05:51:25,220 --> 05:51:26,140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano-ano po yun?

5307
05:51:40,140 --> 05:51:44,780
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Mr. Speaker, noted on this, we will let the agency submit to the Committee for Media Compliance.

5308
05:51:46,180 --> 05:51:47,240
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Isusumiti na lang po namin.

5309
05:51:47,280 --> 05:51:48,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ay, isusumiti po. Okay.

5310
05:51:48,680 --> 05:51:49,600
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Pero, ito po.

5311
05:51:53,600 --> 05:52:12,300
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Isa po ay buniking binukignon, bukidnon, mahagat, amatikanon, inata, inete, kabalyanon, kaluyanen, karulano, malaynon, at orohanon.

5312
05:52:13,000 --> 05:52:18,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, mukhang ang focus po na binabanggit nyo ngayon ay yung mga endangered.

5313
05:52:18,680 --> 05:52:20,740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang pinag-protecting na wika, ganun po ba?

5314
05:52:21,240 --> 05:52:21,720
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Tama po.

5315
05:52:22,260 --> 05:52:24,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At karamihan ay nasa Mindanao.

5316
05:52:25,380 --> 05:52:29,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mga wika ng indigenous groups, tama po ba?

5317
05:52:31,560 --> 05:52:32,220
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Tama po.

5318
05:52:32,220 --> 05:52:48,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Gusto lang po natin malaman, ano yung particular na budget at programa kung meron man ang Commission sa Wikang Filipino para sa Filipino Sign Language?

5319
05:52:48,680 --> 05:53:08,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, nabanggit po ito ng unang nag-interpelate, si representative ko, nais ko pong banggitin din, kaya po ako nagtatanong dahil isang, ako po ang principal author ng Republic Act 11106, Filipino Sign Language Act.

5320
05:53:09,520 --> 05:53:14,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At minamandato po doon, ang lead agency dito ay ang Commission sa Wikang Filipino.

5321
05:53:14,940 --> 05:53:18,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, magkano ang ilalaan?

5322
05:53:18,680 --> 05:53:31,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang pondo ng KWF para sa implementasyon ng Filipino Sign Language Act. Kung meron man.

5323
05:53:37,140 --> 05:53:40,940
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: 4.7 million po for 2027.

5324
05:53:40,940 --> 05:53:48,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 4.7 million pesos. At para saan po yan? Ano po ang specific na gamit dito?

5325
05:53:48,680 --> 05:53:51,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang makalit na halaga na po. Para saan po yan?

5326
05:53:53,300 --> 05:53:59,020
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: For the interpreting systems po, Mr. Speaker.

5327
05:54:00,160 --> 05:54:04,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Interpreting. So, FSL, Filipino Sign Language Interpreting.

5328
05:54:06,340 --> 05:54:06,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

5329
05:54:06,620 --> 05:54:06,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

5330
05:54:07,140 --> 05:54:08,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you.

5331
05:54:12,340 --> 05:54:18,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sapat na po ba yan? Ang pondo na yan ay sapat na para ma-fulfill ang managin?

5332
05:54:18,680 --> 05:54:22,600
