5725
06:28:38,460 --> 06:28:39,020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Angat Dam.

5726
06:28:39,420 --> 06:28:40,520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Napuno na nga yun eh.

5727
06:28:40,520 --> 06:28:43,480
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Nung ilang linggo tayo.

5728
06:28:43,560 --> 06:28:44,540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Napuno na nga yun.

5729
06:28:44,600 --> 06:28:45,920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Nag-release nga sila ng tubig.

5730
