Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya nag-alit si Kongresman Bundok dito, nagmamuras.

5736
06:29:10,560 --> 06:29:12,100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pinasipay ko lang, huwag ka na mag-alit.

5737
06:29:12,400 --> 06:29:13,240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kasi ulan man yan.

5738
06:29:13,560 --> 06:29:19,240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi natin pwedeng pigilin yung ulan, Mr. Speaker, Mr. English Colleague.

5739
06:29:20,540 --> 06:29:23,180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I was telling you, Mr. Speaker, it's good.

5740
