5743
06:29:43,560 --> 06:29:45,500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: 2027, dry season.

5744
06:29:54,500 --> 06:29:59,860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: At least ngayon, Mr. Speaker, Mr. English Colleague, 212 meters para.

5745
06:30:00,000 --> 06:30:03,400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: But nung before sa zona, 150 lang yun.

5746
