Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Grabe talaga ulan.

5747
06:30:06,480 --> 06:30:11,520
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, in short, Mr. Speaker, during the dry season, that would be suffice?

5748
06:30:13,660 --> 06:30:15,100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mayroon naman ang kabantay doon.

5749
06:30:15,180 --> 06:30:18,020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi naman yung payagan na talagang mag-overflow yun.

5750
06:30:18,240 --> 06:30:20,440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Baka sirain pa yung dam na yan. Napakasayang.

5751
