Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Tsaka pag-alita na naman ni Congresswoman Gundok si San Miguel sa airport niya.

5752
06:30:27,900 --> 06:30:29,560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

5753
