5760
06:31:04,180 --> 06:31:04,460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

5761
06:31:04,460 --> 06:31:16,820
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: In connection to this, Mr. Speaker, the department's program, the NWRB Water Resources Vulnerability and Sustainability Assessment Program,

5762
06:31:17,340 --> 06:31:25,720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: produce science-based information on water availability, water quality, groundwater, and climate risks.

5763
06:31:27,100 --> 06:31:27,920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Is this correct?

5764
