5777
06:32:23,200 --> 06:32:24,140
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Bakit po bumaba?

5778
06:32:25,300 --> 06:32:28,020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: How come it was reduced from 137?

5779
06:32:28,040 --> 06:32:29,200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: From 137 to 100 million.

5780
06:32:30,960 --> 06:32:31,700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ang budget?

5781
06:32:35,940 --> 06:32:48,580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: This is true all across the board, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, but yung in particular, NWRB, bumaba talaga from 132, naging 95 na lang, 0.999.

