Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Maganda sana yung progressive na paket na yung gamit ng pera para matugunan lahat ng pangangailangan, but we have to heed the fiscal restraint.

5786
06:33:10,140 --> 06:33:13,520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pati NWRB, bumaba, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

5787
