Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor, but again, meanwhile, the Water Resources Management Program increases from approximately 20 million to 50 million or 154.5%.

5788
06:33:25,640 --> 06:33:27,320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, baka dito napunta naman.

5789
06:33:27,320 --> 06:33:29,500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yung pondo nabawas.

5790
06:33:30,580 --> 06:33:34,000
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Because there's a difference of something like 30 million.

5791
