Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Para magkapanan naman yung...

5796
06:33:57,320 --> 06:33:59,060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

5797
06:33:59,580 --> 06:34:02,140
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung pangangailangan natin doon sa NWRB.

5798
06:34:02,140 --> 06:34:04,340
