Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Not only environmentalist, but it's energy.

5828
06:36:13,880 --> 06:36:18,060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And of course, to the secretary, you have a good team.

5829
06:36:18,260 --> 06:36:22,680
