06:36:26,460 --> 06:36:28,180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: At isa rin sa pinakamagalya.

5832
06:36:28,300 --> 06:36:34,080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Again, for the 2027 budget of the DNR, I fully support po ang budget.

5833
06:36:34,340 --> 06:36:40,220
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Dapat dagdagan po natin ito kasi ito po ang ating pinakaimportanteng department.

5834
06:36:40,440 --> 06:36:41,600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you very much, Mr. Speaker.

5835
