Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Lisod ka ayo i-bisaya kay naka-Englishman ng akong kwestyon, no?

5862
06:38:09,240 --> 06:38:10,580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So mag-English na lang ta.

5863
06:38:12,140 --> 06:38:15,060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor,

5864
06:38:15,760 --> 06:38:21,300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para sa aking katanungan, unahin ko ang usapin ng karapatan ng ating mga katutubo.

5865
06:38:21,960 --> 06:38:24,280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor,

5866
06:38:24,280 --> 06:38:26,280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: can you confirm that...

5867
06:38:26,460 --> 06:38:32,240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ...projects under the DNR's jurisdiction require free, prior, and informed consent

5868
06:38:32,240 --> 06:38:37,660
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: kapag ito ay within or overlaps with an ancestral domain?

5869
06:38:39,640 --> 06:38:41,800
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yes, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

5870
06:38:42,440 --> 06:38:44,400
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: FPIC is always required.

5871
06:38:45,000 --> 06:38:45,960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

5872
06:38:46,380 --> 06:38:54,020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Good sponsor, ano po ang examples ng mga projects na kadalasan nangangailangan ng mga FPIC

5873
06:38:54,020 --> 06:38:56,020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: kapag ito ay within or...

5874
06:38:56,460 --> 06:38:58,560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ...overlaps an ancestral domain.

5875
06:38:58,880 --> 06:39:01,700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung within, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague,

5876
06:39:02,480 --> 06:39:03,380
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ano mga projects?

5877
06:39:03,640 --> 06:39:06,580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Water system, hydroelectric plants,

5878
06:39:07,320 --> 06:39:12,280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: eh, yung malawakang pagtanim sa dalawang kanti o kansi.

5879
06:39:12,960 --> 06:39:15,640
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kailangan, unahin mo muna yung isa.

5880
06:39:15,900 --> 06:39:20,220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi pwedeng ipagsabay mo yung FPIC sa dalawang magkatabing kansi o kanti.

5881
06:39:20,220 --> 06:39:26,340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Para magkaroon ka ng dalawang approval para yung overlapping plantation mo sa...

5882
06:39:26,340 --> 06:39:26,840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ...kabila.

5883
06:39:27,020 --> 06:39:32,760
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Limbawa, pagkatanim ng kape dito sa kansi, sa may kansi dito, kumuha mong FPIC ka rin sa kabila.

5884
06:39:33,080 --> 06:39:36,240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, yan po ang procedure.

5885
06:39:36,820 --> 06:39:39,920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po yun, no, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

5886
06:39:40,560 --> 06:39:49,960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Can the DENR confirm if the 2027 budget includes a specific allocation for FPIC monitoring and enforcement?

5887
06:39:50,960 --> 06:39:51,160
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Bah!

5888
06:39:51,800 --> 06:39:52,920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sandali lang, Mr. Speaker.

5889
06:39:54,460 --> 06:39:56,320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: FPIC, hindi DENR ang gumagastos noon.

5890
06:39:56,340 --> 06:39:57,940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: NCIP dapat, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

5891
06:39:58,340 --> 06:39:59,920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

5892
06:40:00,740 --> 06:40:03,520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: For monitoring and enforcement purposes.

5893
06:40:03,600 --> 06:40:07,300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pwede sila mag-present kasi sila yung issue ng CADC at saka CADT.

5894
06:40:07,520 --> 06:40:10,320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pwede sila mag-present doon kasama ng NCIP.

5895
06:40:10,780 --> 06:40:15,920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: But principal, basta may CADC at saka CADT, lalo na overlapping, NCIP talaga yun.

5896
06:40:15,980 --> 06:40:18,020
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang DENR observer lang po doon, Mr. Speaker.

5897
06:40:18,020 --> 06:40:26,220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, ibig sabihin po, distinguished sponsor, wala pong nakalaang budget para sa monitoring ng FPIC.

5898
06:40:26,340 --> 06:40:28,440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And enforcement nito sa DENR.

5899
06:40:28,600 --> 06:40:30,980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: FPIC, observe lang sila doon.

5900
06:40:31,080 --> 06:40:36,200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pero yung, if your project is big enough, kailangan ka ng ECC, di ba?

5901
06:40:36,860 --> 06:40:38,500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: ECC is a planning tool.

5902
06:40:38,840 --> 06:40:41,820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ayun, DENR doon, may budget sila para doon.

5903
06:40:41,900 --> 06:40:42,520
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Meron,

5904
06:40:42,520 --> 06:40:42,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: okay.

5905
06:40:43,060 --> 06:40:46,680
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: How much po ang nakalaan para dito sa NEP ng 2027?

5906
06:40:54,580 --> 06:40:56,300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pakaliit pa lang nito, Mr. Speaker.

5907
06:40:56,340 --> 06:41:03,360
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pero, yung AMB, MGV, NWRB, 726 million lang sa 2026, ga-a.

5908
06:41:04,220 --> 06:41:09,660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ngayon, we're asking for 816 sa 2027 NEP.

5909
06:41:10,300 --> 06:41:12,060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Distinguish sa colleague, Mr. Speaker.

5910
06:41:14,160 --> 06:41:20,440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Naka-line item po ba ito o nakapaloob lamang sa general monitoring funds ng DENR?

5911
06:41:22,380 --> 06:41:24,600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Nakapaloob, Mr. Speaker, sa general fund.

5912
06:41:24,600 --> 06:41:26,040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Good sponsor.

5913
06:41:26,340 --> 06:41:31,300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya ako ito, tinatanong ko, dahil kung walang malinaw na budget line,

5914
06:41:31,700 --> 06:41:40,460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: paano po masisiguro ng DENR na ang FPIC ay fully implemented at hindi magiging token ng compliance lamang?

5915
06:41:40,940 --> 06:41:49,000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, I will now proceed with the tools na mahalaga para sa environmental oversight naman po.

5916
06:41:49,000 --> 06:41:54,860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang Executive Order No. 79, dated July 7 of 2012,

5917
06:41:54,860 --> 06:42:01,560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at Executive Order No. 130, dated April 14 of 2021,

5918
06:42:02,460 --> 06:42:08,820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: call for the updating and issuance of updated unified maps of mining areas,

5919
06:42:09,400 --> 06:42:13,160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: geohazard areas, protected areas, and watersheds.

5920
06:42:13,700 --> 06:42:18,620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Naproduce po ba ng DENR ang unified map na ito?

5921
06:42:18,620 --> 06:42:21,480
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mayroon bang map na yan?

5922
06:42:23,440 --> 06:42:24,540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ah, Mr. Speaker.

5923
06:42:24,860 --> 06:42:34,860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: As distinguished colleague, mayroong updated map by virtue of that Executive Order na laganap po nilang naplane yung tungkol sa MINA at sa mga boundaries.

5924
06:42:35,560 --> 06:42:36,860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mayroon po, Mr. Speaker.

5925
06:42:37,500 --> 06:42:39,640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So may unified na map po tayo.

5926
06:42:39,760 --> 06:42:50,800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mayroon bang line item din po dito na for 2027 budget sa DENR ang inalocate para naman po makontinue yung unified map na ito at magkano?

5927
06:42:50,800 --> 06:42:51,300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mayroon?

5928
06:42:51,860 --> 06:42:52,340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Saan?

5929
06:43:11,800 --> 06:43:13,350
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mayroon, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

5930
06:43:13,440 --> 06:43:13,940
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Thank you.

5931
06:43:13,940 --> 06:43:19,880
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang amount para po magtuloy-tuloy yan, 713 million.

5932
06:43:20,460 --> 06:43:21,260
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Salamat po.

5933
06:43:21,260 --> 06:43:28,340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kung naproduce po ito, nakascade na po ba ito sa mga LGUs para po for their own use?

5934
06:43:29,960 --> 06:43:30,220
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Oo.

5935
06:43:30,220 --> 06:43:30,840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yung MAPA.

5936
06:43:31,780 --> 06:43:37,340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ah, yung MAPA, nabigyan na yung mga concerned LGUs na po.

5937
06:43:38,440 --> 06:43:41,100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sir Speaker, distinguished colleague. Mayroon, nabigyan po sila.

5938
06:43:41,280 --> 06:43:41,960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Salamat po.

5939
06:43:41,960 --> 06:43:50,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, patuloy pa rin ba ang DENR sa pag-supervise ng mine audits?

5940
06:43:50,780 --> 06:43:55,600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At kung patuloy pa rin ito, magkano ang budget na nakalaan para dito?

5941
06:43:55,780 --> 06:43:59,320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Under what line item for 2027 budget po?

5942
06:43:59,900 --> 06:44:00,580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mine audit?

5943
06:44:01,540 --> 06:44:01,760
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala?

5944
06:44:04,660 --> 06:44:06,320
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi ko alam magkano budget po.

5945
06:44:12,800 --> 06:44:14,380
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Sorry, time pa lang.

5946
06:44:14,380 --> 06:44:14,500
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Okay.

5947
06:44:17,400 --> 06:44:17,860
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Dali lang.

5948
06:44:18,440 --> 06:44:19,840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Dali, ako pa 6 minutes.

5949
06:44:28,780 --> 06:44:30,900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

5950
06:44:31,160 --> 06:44:38,420
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung strengthening doon sa, ayun, para magpatuloy, maliit man ito, nakakahiya.

5951
06:44:38,900 --> 06:44:46,340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: 23 million, baka manipaigo, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, para mapatuloy yung mapping na yun.

5952
06:44:46,540 --> 06:44:47,140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po.

5953
06:44:47,140 --> 06:44:49,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tingin ko po, ito'y kulang din po, no?

5954
06:44:50,020 --> 06:44:50,380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Oo.

5955
06:44:50,380 --> 06:45:00,000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para mapagpatuloy nila yung patungkol sa budget na ito para masupervise nila yung pag-audit sa mga...

5956
06:45:00,000 --> 06:45:29,160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Anyway, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, kaugnay pa rin po sa mining, ano ang status of the mining in Sibuyan Island owned by Altai Minerals Development Corporation, nakarating po sa aking opisina na ito ay temporarily nahinto dahil sa barikada ng mga mamamayan at mismo ang LGU at local residents ang nagpapatawag na i-cancel na ang mining contract.

5957
06:45:30,000 --> 06:45:40,580
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, di ba yung Sibuyan Island, maliit lang nga yun eh. So dapat talaga i-suspendihin. As of now, suspended yun, Mr. Speaker, I'm distinguished colleague.

5958
06:45:40,760 --> 06:45:43,940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: May plano po ba ang DNR na i-resume ito?

5959
06:45:44,460 --> 06:45:45,880
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Wala pa, Mr. Speaker.

5960
06:45:45,880 --> 06:45:47,060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

5961
06:45:47,200 --> 06:45:52,880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Hinding-hindi dapat maging kapalit ng mining ang karapatan at mabuting kalagayan ng mga komunidad.

5962
06:45:53,880 --> 06:45:59,880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang kahit anong economic activity sa ating bansa ay dapat nakaayon sa utos ng Saligang Batas.

5963
06:46:00,000 --> 06:46:05,900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Na bawat Pilipino ay may karapatan sa isang balanced at healthful ecology.

5964
06:46:06,520 --> 06:46:11,160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Mr. Sponsor, sa pagsagot sa mga tanong na iyan.

5965
06:46:11,640 --> 06:46:19,900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ngayon po, nais ko naman pong balikan ang issue patungkol sa Financial or Technical Assistance Agreements o FTAA.

5966
06:46:20,700 --> 06:46:26,100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Noong budget briefing po, na-raise ko ang tungkol sa renewal ng FTAAs.

5967
06:46:26,100 --> 06:46:29,980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Can the DNR explain their role in the FTAA?

5968
06:46:30,000 --> 06:46:45,660
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Isa lang, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague. Sa Region 1, yung Altamina Exploration and Resources, Iron Ore, Gold and Vanadium Resources (Philippines), Inc.

5969
06:46:45,800 --> 06:46:48,540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sa Region 2, yung OceanaGold.

5970
06:46:49,940 --> 06:46:56,300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sa MIMAROPA, sa amin, yung Agusan Petroleum and Minerals Corporation, pero hindi pa ito pinayagan.

5971
06:46:57,080 --> 06:46:58,840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Region 12, Sagittarius Mines.

5972
06:46:58,840 --> 06:46:59,900
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Lahat ito.

5973
06:47:00,000 --> 06:47:06,020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, ano po kaya ang role ng DNR dito sa FTAAs?

5974
06:47:06,040 --> 06:47:08,140
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Nagmo-monitor lang, Mr. Speaker, ng compliance.

5975
06:47:08,220 --> 06:47:09,560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Monitoring. Salamat po.

5976
06:47:09,980 --> 06:47:18,980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kinoconfirm din po sa budget hearing na DNR na merong allocated budget para sa monitoring at enforcement ng FTAAs.

5977
06:47:19,460 --> 06:47:29,080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Distinguished Sponsor, paano ginagamit ng DNR ang halagang ito para palakasin ang monitoring at enforcement ng FTAAs?

5978
06:47:29,080 --> 06:47:36,340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, siyempre, kung may pera sila, they have to travel kasi they cannot do the monitoring dito lang sila sa Manila.

5979
06:47:36,500 --> 06:47:38,600
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pumunta katulad sa Cebu yan, they have to go there.

5980
06:47:39,060 --> 06:47:41,820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Katulad doon sa Humonhon, kailangan pumunta sila doon.

5981
06:47:42,320 --> 06:47:43,240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang daming mina.

5982
06:47:43,860 --> 06:47:48,200
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Sa Palawan nga, meron kaming mining moratorium for 50 years, pinirmahan nila.

5983
06:47:49,060 --> 06:47:52,340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, wala na kaming bagong ina-accept ng mga application.

5984
06:47:52,960 --> 06:47:58,080
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya yung ibang mga probinsya, sabihin mo, Mr. Speaker, gumawa din ng mining moratorium.

5985
06:47:59,080 --> 06:48:03,000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Sponsor.

5986
06:48:03,420 --> 06:48:14,020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Iko-confirm ko lang din po na sakaling may nahuli kayo dito na lumalabag sa FTAAs po during your monitoring, ano po yung ginagawa nila?

5987
06:48:15,600 --> 06:48:16,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Distinguished sponsor.

5988
06:48:20,080 --> 06:48:24,500
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung nag-ooperate pa yan, Mr. Speaker, suspended immediately.

5989
06:48:25,220 --> 06:48:29,040
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Pagkatapos, pag nag-violet pa talaga, eh talagang hindi lang suspended.

5990
06:48:29,080 --> 06:48:30,460
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yan, multahan yan.

5991
06:48:31,040 --> 06:48:38,560
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung hindi naman madala sa multa, eh ang DNR, baka ilibing na lang nila yun doon sa gamitin yung bakho, Mr. Speaker.

5992
06:48:39,300 --> 06:48:40,860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kinakasuhan din po ba natin?

5993
06:48:41,160 --> 06:48:43,040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Eh, due process pala. I'm sorry.

5994
06:48:43,540 --> 06:48:48,260
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi pala pwede yung bakho gagamitin doon pag hindi sumunod sa DNR.

5995
06:48:50,120 --> 06:48:52,760
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, kinakasuhan po natin sakaling lumabag?

5996
06:48:52,760 --> 06:48:53,700
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaso, multa.

5997
06:48:53,700 --> 06:48:57,060
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Hindi pa talaga pumayag sa multa.

5998
06:48:57,080 --> 06:48:57,480
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Bakho.

5999
06:48:57,480 --> 06:48:58,980
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Eh, lalo na kung hindi.

6000
06:48:59,080 --> 06:49:03,920
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kaya naman, Pilipino citizen, eh alam mo na kung anong parosa, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

6001
06:49:04,220 --> 06:49:04,700
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po.

6002
06:49:05,040 --> 06:49:12,160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kasama rin po ba rito ang pagsuri kung compliant ang isang FTAA proposal sa mga requirements

6003
06:49:12,160 --> 06:49:17,960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: gaya ng Environmental Compliance Certificate or FPIC bago ito ma-approve?

6004
06:49:18,120 --> 06:49:20,800
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Tama, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague. You're very correct.

6005
06:49:20,800 --> 06:49:28,440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Na-e-ensure ba ng DNR na ang mga renewal ay di nagiging automatic at sumasailalim pa rin

6006
06:49:28,440 --> 06:49:30,540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa pagpasa ng mga requirements?

6007
06:49:30,560 --> 06:49:33,540
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Mr. Speaker, hindi automatic. Talagang ina-isa-isa yan.

6008
06:49:33,900 --> 06:49:37,780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po sa pag-confirm, Mr. Sponsor.

6009
06:49:38,280 --> 06:49:45,360
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, ngayong araw ko lang po natanggap ang sagot ng DNR

6010
06:49:45,360 --> 06:49:50,280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: hinggil sa FTAA No. 1 ng Oceana Gold Philippines Inc.

6011
06:49:50,280 --> 06:49:54,260
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at FTAA No. 2 ng Tampakan Project.

6012
06:49:54,860 --> 06:49:58,280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang paliwanag ng DNR ay sa FTAA No. 1,

6013
06:49:58,440 --> 06:50:05,420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: walang grave abuse of discretion dahil ito raw ay sumusunod sa intention of the agreement.

6014
06:50:05,800 --> 06:50:11,880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At ang FTAA No. 2, restoration of the lost term naman daw po.

6015
06:50:12,420 --> 06:50:18,440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Paano po ito na ipapaliwanag ng DNR sa ating mga lokal, sa ating mga katutubo?

6016
06:50:19,860 --> 06:50:27,840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Binababaan po ba natin ang ating mga komunidad para sabihin ang ganitong technical na reasoning sa kanila?

6017
06:50:28,440 --> 06:50:36,300
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Siyempre, Mr. Speaker, unang-una, hirap ka mang pumasok doon kung may mga katutubong nagbabantay.

6018
06:50:36,760 --> 06:50:38,440
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, kailangan kasapin mo yan sila.

6019
06:50:39,120 --> 06:50:43,340
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Katulad ng Tampakan, eh patagal yan natulog ang Tampakan eh. Ngayon na lang yan tinatampak.

6020
06:50:43,920 --> 06:50:48,780
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So, hopefully, if you ask me, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

6021
06:50:48,860 --> 06:50:50,960
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: yung mina hindi naman talagang masama per se.

6022
06:50:51,360 --> 06:50:54,880
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Basta huwag lang mag-abuso. Lalong-lalo na kung yung nagmimina ay Pilipino.

6023
06:50:55,440 --> 06:50:58,120
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Ang ayaw natin makita, kung yung nagmimina,

6024
06:50:58,440 --> 06:51:01,960
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: hindi Pilipino. Dahil ang mina, reserve lang yan, natural resources,

6025
06:51:02,320 --> 06:51:05,160
