06:55:26,280 --> 06:55:28,280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: O yun, palakpak!

6077
06:55:28,280 --> 06:55:30,280
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Salamat, salamat.

6078
06:55:36,280 --> 06:55:47,280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: During, with regards to the MPSA, during the DENR budget briefing, concerns were raised regarding possible violations of the terms and conditions

6079
06:55:47,280 --> 06:55:48,280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: governing these mining operations in MPSA.

6080
06:55:48,280 --> 06:55:57,280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: The MPSA itself requires compliance with the Mining Act.

6081
06:55:57,280 --> 06:56:04,280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Its implementing rules, Madam Speaker, approve work programs and other applicable laws.

6082
06:56:04,280 --> 06:56:14,280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: DENR, on the other hand, retains regularity, supervisory, and monitoring authority.

6083
06:56:14,280 --> 06:56:16,280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ang tanong,

6084
06:56:16,280 --> 06:56:37,280
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: maaari po bang mangako ulit ang DENR na ang kanilang isa sa gawa ay comprehensive review ng MPSA na ito, kasama ang lahat ng mga amendments, assignment, operating agreements, at kung nasusunod ba talaga ang mga terms and conditions dito?

